# C++ Calculator

My first C++ project - a simple console calculator

## Features

- Addition
- Subtraction
- Multiplication
- Division
- Input validation
- Division by zero check

## Technologies

- C++
- Standard Library (<iostream>)

## How to Run

1 Open the project in Visual Studio
2 Build the project
3 Run the calculator





